WEBVTT

00:03.103 --> 00:04.310
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:04.344 --> 00:06.137
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:06.172 --> 00:07.551
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:07.586 --> 00:09.482
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:09.517 --> 00:12.551
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:12.586 --> 00:14.827
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:14.862 --> 00:16.827
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:16.862 --> 00:18.862
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:18.896 --> 00:20.517
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:20.551 --> 00:22.862
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:22.896 --> 00:24.379
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:24.413 --> 00:26.827
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:26.862 --> 00:28.758
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:28.793 --> 00:30.793
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.827 --> 00:32.724
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:32.758 --> 00:34.689
SPONGEBOB
SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝
方裤！

00:34.724 --> 00:35.931
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:35.965 --> 00:38.241
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:38.275 --> 00:40.689
[laughing]
[笑]

00:40.724 --> 00:42.862
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:42.896 --> 00:44.379
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:47.103 --> 00:50.068
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

00:50.103 --> 00:58.000
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:59.586 --> 01:00.965
[clock ticking]
[时钟滴答作响]

01:01.000 --> 01:09.310
[foghorn blows]
[雾号吹响]

01:09.344 --> 01:11.379
- PATRICK!
- 帕特里克！

01:11.413 --> 01:12.965
TEE TIME, PATRICK!
开球时间，帕特里克！

01:13.000 --> 01:15.724
PATRICK! TEE TIME, PATRICK!
帕特里克！开球时间，帕特里克！

01:15.758 --> 01:18.034
PATRICK, WAKE UP!
帕特里克，醒醒！

01:18.068 --> 01:20.344
- READY TO LOSE?
- 准备好失败了吗？

01:20.379 --> 01:23.827
WEATHER PERMITTING,
OF COURSE.
如果天气允许，
当然。

01:23.862 --> 01:27.103
[thunder crashes]
[雷霆轰鸣]

01:27.137 --> 01:28.344
- AW!
- 哇！

01:28.379 --> 01:30.310
HOW ARE WE SUPPOSED TO GOLF
IN THIS DOWNPOUR?
我们应该如何打高尔夫球
在这倾盆大雨中？

01:30.344 --> 01:33.275
OUR PUTTERS ARE GETTING
WATERLOGGED.
我们的推杆正在获得
积水了。

01:33.310 --> 01:34.689
- DUMB RAIN!
- 愚蠢的雨！

01:34.724 --> 01:37.068
DOESN'T IT KNOW I'M
THE SHERRIFF IN THESE PARTS?
难道它不知道我是
这些地方的警长？

01:37.103 --> 01:39.275
HEY, RAIN,
YOU'D BETTER STOP THAT!
嘿，雨，
你最好停下来！

01:39.310 --> 01:40.241
[thunder crashes]
[雷霆轰鸣]

01:40.275 --> 01:41.896
AAH!
啊啊！

01:41.931 --> 01:43.137
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:43.172 --> 01:45.517
- AAH! AAH!
- 啊啊！啊啊！

01:45.551 --> 01:49.275
AAH!
啊啊！

01:49.310 --> 01:50.379
[crackling]
[爆裂声]

01:50.413 --> 01:51.413
[shattering]
[破碎]

01:51.448 --> 01:53.275
- IF YOU TWO DON'T MIND,
- 如果你们两个不介意的话

01:53.310 --> 01:55.310
COULD YOU KEEP IT DOWN
TO A LOW RUMBLE?
你能小声一点吗
低沉的隆隆声？

01:55.344 --> 01:57.586
both: SORRY, SQUIDWARD.
两人：对不起，章鱼哥。

01:57.620 --> 01:59.241
- I GUESS WE WERE JUST SO UPSET
ABOUT THE RAIN AND HOW--
- 我想我们只是太沮丧了
关于下雨以及下雨的原因——

01:59.275 --> 02:00.655
- DON'T CARE.
- 不在乎。

02:00.689 --> 02:01.655
[loud slam]
[大声撞击]

02:01.689 --> 02:03.965
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

02:04.000 --> 02:04.965
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

02:05.000 --> 02:06.586
I WAS REALLY LOOKING
FORWARD TO A DAY
我真的很想看
展望未来的一天

02:06.620 --> 02:08.655
OF SPORTSMANSHIP
AND MALE BONDING.
体育精神
和男性关系。

02:08.689 --> 02:11.413
THANKS A LOT, RAIN!
非常感谢，雨！

02:11.448 --> 02:13.758
- OW.
-哦。

02:13.793 --> 02:16.551
- SAY, THAT GIVES ME
AN IDEA.
- 说，这给了我
一个想法。

02:16.586 --> 02:20.206
- WHAT FOLLOWS IS
A BRIEF CONSTRUCTION MONTAGE.
- 接下来是
简短的构造蒙太奇。

02:20.241 --> 02:23.172
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

02:23.206 --> 02:27.965
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

02:28.000 --> 02:31.551
WE HOPE YOU ENJOYED THIS
BRIEF CONSTRUCTION MONTAGE.
我们希望您喜欢这个
简短的构造蒙太奇。

02:31.586 --> 02:33.758
[drilling and hammering]
[钻孔和锤击]

02:33.793 --> 02:39.862
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

02:44.172 --> 02:47.758
[sawing and drilling]
[锯切和钻孔]

02:47.793 --> 02:50.241
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

02:51.931 --> 02:54.517
[pounding and grunting]
[重击和咕噜声]

02:54.551 --> 02:56.344
- HELLO!
- 你好！

02:56.379 --> 02:57.724
NITWIT MORONS.
白痴。

02:57.758 --> 02:58.758
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:58.793 --> 03:00.344
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

03:00.379 --> 03:01.965
- OH, HI, SQUIDWARD.
- 哦，嗨，章鱼哥。

03:02.000 --> 03:03.758
UP FROM YOUR SLUMBER,
I SEE.
从睡梦中醒来，
我明白了。

03:03.793 --> 03:06.275
WELL, YOU'RE JUST IN TIME
TO INDULGE IN A FRIENDLY GAME
好吧，你来得正是时候
享受一场友好的游戏

03:06.310 --> 03:08.551
OF INDOOR MINIATURE GOLF.
室内迷你高尔夫球场。

03:08.586 --> 03:11.379
- I WILL NOT INDULGE
IN ANYTHING FRIENDLY
- 我不会纵容
任何友好的事情

03:11.413 --> 03:13.620
OR OTHERWISE WITH THE LIKES
OF YOU TWO!
或以其他方式与喜欢
你们两个！

03:13.655 --> 03:16.620
AND PRESENTLY, I AM
HEADING BACK TO ENJOY
目前，我是
返回享受

03:16.655 --> 03:20.275
A WELL-DESERVED
MID-MORNING NAP.
当之无愧
上午小睡。

03:20.310 --> 03:23.034
- BUT WE SCULPTED
YOUR LIKENESS OUT OF BUTTER
- 但我们雕刻了
黄油中的你的肖像

03:23.068 --> 03:26.724
ON HOLE FIVE.
在第五洞。

03:26.758 --> 03:28.620
- I DON'T CARE!
- 我不在乎！

03:28.655 --> 03:30.413
LISTEN UP.
听着。

03:30.448 --> 03:34.620
I WILL NOT BE WOKEN
FROM MY NAP AGAIN,
我不会被吵醒
再次从我的小睡中，

03:34.655 --> 03:37.586
AND IF I AM, I'M GONNA--
如果我是，我会——

03:37.620 --> 03:39.241
- JOIN US ON THE BACK NINE?
- 加入我们的后九洞？

03:39.275 --> 03:41.758
- JUST DON'T LET IT
HAPPEN AGAIN!
- 只是不要让它
再次发生！

03:41.793 --> 03:45.206
OR ELSE.
或者其他。

03:45.241 --> 03:46.931
- LET'S GET THIS GAME
TEED OFF.
- 让我们来玩这个游戏
开球。

03:52.517 --> 03:55.034
YOU'RE UP FIRST,
MY GOOD MAN.
你是第一个，
我的好人。

03:55.068 --> 03:57.482
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

03:57.517 --> 04:00.758
OOH, OOH-OOH.
噢，噢——噢。

04:00.793 --> 04:03.000
KA KA KA KA KA KA KA.
咔咔咔咔咔咔咔。

04:03.034 --> 04:05.068
[ululating]
[哀嚎]

04:05.103 --> 04:07.275
- I AM WARNING YOU TWO,
- 我警告你们两个，

04:07.310 --> 04:10.275
KEEP IT DOWN!
保持低调！

04:10.310 --> 04:13.103
- BETTER TONE DOWN
THE CALISTHENICS, PATRICK.
- 更好地降低语气
健美操，帕特里克。

04:13.137 --> 04:14.517
DON'T WANT TO UPSET
SQUIDWARD.
不想心烦意乱
章鱼哥。

04:14.551 --> 04:17.586
- CAN'T WAIT TO LOSE, HUH?
- 等不及要输了，是吗？

04:27.344 --> 04:29.137
NO!
不！

04:29.172 --> 04:30.344
OOH!
哦！

04:30.379 --> 04:32.827
IF YOU HAD JUST LET ME
FINISH MY STRETCHES,
如果你让我
完成我的伸展运动，

04:32.862 --> 04:34.827
I WOULDN'T HAVE MISSED
MY FIRST SHOT!
我不会错过
我的第一枪！

04:34.862 --> 04:36.172
- OH, DON'T WORRY, PATRICK.
- 哦，别担心，帕特里克。

04:36.206 --> 04:37.586
I'M SURE YOU'LL GET
THE HANG OF IT.
我相信你会得到
它的窍门。

04:37.620 --> 04:40.310
BESIDES, WE'RE JUST PLAYING
FOR FUN, RIGHT?
此外，我们只是在玩
为了好玩，对吗？

04:40.344 --> 04:43.206
AND BACK, AND...
然后回来，然后……

04:46.241 --> 04:49.689
- NICE SHOT.
- 好球。

04:49.724 --> 04:50.689
- WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
- 你在干什么？

04:50.724 --> 04:51.965
- MOVING MY BALL.
- 移动我的球。

04:52.000 --> 04:53.793
- PATRICK, YOU HAVE TO
PLAY IT WHERE IT LANDS.
- 帕特里克，你必须这样做
落地即播放。

04:53.827 --> 04:57.862
- FINE.
HAVE IT YOUR WAY.
- 美好的。
随心所欲。

05:00.241 --> 05:02.137
READY TO GIVE UP?
准备好放弃了吗？

05:02.172 --> 05:03.448
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

05:03.482 --> 05:07.482
HAH! LET'S SEE HOW YOU DO
AGAINST THE WINDMILL.
哈！让我们看看你表现如何
反对风车。

05:07.517 --> 05:09.275
YOU HAVEN'T GOT A CHANCE.
你没有机会。

05:09.310 --> 05:11.241
- YOU KNOW, PATRICK,
THIS IS JUST A GAME.
- 你知道，帕特里克，
这只是一个游戏。

05:11.275 --> 05:13.482
- OH, IT ISJUST A GAME,
- 哦，这只是一个游戏，

05:13.517 --> 05:15.379
WHICH I AM GONNA WIN.
我会赢的。

05:15.413 --> 05:18.275
- I THINK YOU'RE MISSING
THE POINT.
- 我想你失踪了
重点。

05:18.310 --> 05:19.724
- SPEAKING OF...
- 说到...

05:19.758 --> 05:21.448
M-M-M-MISSING!
嗯——嗯——失踪了！

05:21.482 --> 05:22.965
[clank]
[铮铮]

05:23.000 --> 05:24.034
HAH!
哈！

05:24.068 --> 05:26.482
♪ GOTTA PLAY IT
WHERE IT LANDS ♪
♪ 一定要玩它
它降落在哪里 ♪

05:26.517 --> 05:28.827
WATCH AND LEARN,
SQUAREPANTS.
观看和学习，
方裤。

05:28.862 --> 05:32.172
WATCH AND LEARN.
观看并学习。

05:35.172 --> 05:38.827
[rattling]
[嘎嘎声]

05:39.965 --> 05:42.620
YES! LET'S SEE
IF YOU CAN TOP THAT!
是的！让我们看看
如果你能做到的话！

05:42.655 --> 05:44.551
- OKAY.
- 好的。

05:47.000 --> 05:49.241
- SPONGEBOB READIES
THE APPROACH SHOT.
- 海绵宝宝准备好了
进场射击。

05:49.275 --> 05:51.965
HE'S GOTTA BE VERY CAREFUL
HE DOESN'T HOOK THE SHOT HERE,
他必须非常小心
他不在这里投篮，

05:52.000 --> 05:55.275
BECAUSE THIS WOULD CERTAINLY
BE AN INOPPORTUNE TIME
因为这肯定会
时机不合时宜

05:55.310 --> 05:56.586
FOR A BOGEY.
柏忌。

05:56.620 --> 05:59.551
A PRESSURE-PACKED SHOT
TO BE SURE.
充满压力的镜头
可以肯定的是。

06:00.724 --> 06:03.689
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

06:03.724 --> 06:05.586
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

06:05.620 --> 06:09.241
[rattling]
[嘎嘎声]

06:09.275 --> 06:10.241
[screeches]
[尖叫声]

06:10.275 --> 06:11.655
friends: AW!
朋友们：哇！

06:11.689 --> 06:12.793
[quiet chatter]
[安静的谈话]

06:12.827 --> 06:14.034
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

06:14.068 --> 06:17.793
- LOOKS LIKE WE'RE TIED,
THREE SHOTS TO THREE.
- 看来我们打成平手了
三比三。

06:17.827 --> 06:19.034
- HEH! SHOTS.
- 嘿！镜头。

06:19.068 --> 06:21.000
THEY'RE CALLED STROKES
IN GOLF, PATRICK.
它们被称为中风
在高尔夫领域，帕特里克。

06:21.034 --> 06:22.206
NOT SHOTS.
不是射击。

06:22.241 --> 06:23.310
- WHATEVER.
- 任何。

06:24.758 --> 06:26.275
[rattling]
[嘎嘎声]

06:26.310 --> 06:29.379
AND HE SINKS ANOTHER
HOLE IN ONE!
他又沉没了一个
一杆进洞！

06:29.413 --> 06:31.172
THAT'S TWO IN A ROW!
这是连续两次！

06:31.206 --> 06:32.551
- ALL RIGHT!
- 好的！

06:32.586 --> 06:35.448
YOU WANT TO PLAY
COMPETITIVE, EH?
你想玩吗
有竞争力，呃？

06:35.482 --> 06:37.931
OBSERVE!
观察！

06:43.241 --> 06:46.275
RIGHT BETWEEN
THE OLD WICKET.
就在中间
旧检票口。

06:48.517 --> 06:50.448
COME ON, BALLY.
DON'T FAIL ME NOW.
来吧，巴利。
现在别让我失望。

06:50.482 --> 06:52.448
- WATCH OUT
FOR THE WATER HAZARD.
- 小心
针对水灾。

06:52.482 --> 06:55.413
- PATRICK, THE ONLY
HAZARD I CAN SEE
- 帕特里克，唯一
我能看到的危险

06:55.448 --> 06:56.896
IS YOU
STANDING IN MY SHOT!
是你吗
站在我的镜头里！

06:56.931 --> 06:59.413
- I HAVE NO IDEA
WHAT YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT.
- 我不知道
你在说什么。

06:59.448 --> 07:01.275
- FINE! BE THAT WAY!
- 美好的！就这样吧！

07:01.310 --> 07:03.931
I'LL JUST GO AROUND YOU.
我就绕着你走。

07:05.965 --> 07:08.310
[shattering glass, splat]
[玻璃破碎，啪嗒啪嗒]

07:08.344 --> 07:09.965
OOPS.
哎呀。

07:10.000 --> 07:11.000
- SHOW OFF!
- 炫耀！

07:11.034 --> 07:13.172
I CAN DO THAT.
我能做到。

07:13.206 --> 07:14.172
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:14.206 --> 07:15.137
GAAH!
啊啊！

07:15.172 --> 07:16.172
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

07:16.206 --> 07:17.586
[ball zooms, glass shatters]
[球变焦，玻璃破碎]

07:17.620 --> 07:20.172
OH, WHERE DID
OUR BALLS GO?
哦，在哪里
我们的球去了吗？

07:20.206 --> 07:23.482
- HOW DO I KNOW?
I WAS JUST COPYING YOU.
- 我怎么知道？
我只是在抄袭你。

07:23.517 --> 07:24.551
- UH-OH.
- 呃-哦。

07:24.586 --> 07:26.034
[glass fragments clink]
[玻璃碎片叮当作响]

07:27.517 --> 07:29.689
OH, WELL, I GUESS
THAT'S GAME POINT.
哦，好吧，我猜
这就是游戏要点。

07:29.724 --> 07:32.068
- OH, HO HO HO,
HOLD ON THERE, FELLA.
- 哦，嗬嗬嗬，
坚持住，伙计。

07:32.103 --> 07:34.034
IT'S NOT OVER YET.
事情还没有结束。

07:34.068 --> 07:35.586
- BUT REMEMBER
WHAT SQUIDWARD SAID?
- 但请记住
章鱼哥说了什么？

07:35.620 --> 07:37.482
WE CAN'T MAKE ANY NOISE!
我们不能发出任何噪音！

07:37.517 --> 07:40.103
- WHO SAID ANYTHING
ABOUT NOISE?
- 谁说了算
关于噪音？

07:40.137 --> 07:43.068
WE'RE JUST GONNA GET
OUT OF THE ROUGH
我们即将得到
走出困境

07:43.103 --> 07:44.862
AND BACK TO THE COURSE.
回到正题。

07:44.896 --> 07:46.206
- HEY!
- 嘿！

07:49.379 --> 07:50.896
[whispers]
PATRICK!
[窃窃私语]
帕特里克！

07:51.931 --> 07:53.137
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

07:53.172 --> 07:54.137
[Patrick chomping food]
[帕特里克咀嚼食物]

07:54.172 --> 07:55.551
[chewing loudly]
[大声咀嚼]

07:55.586 --> 07:56.793
WHAT'S THE BIG IDEA?
有什么好主意？

07:56.827 --> 07:58.482
I THOUGHT WE WERE IN HERE
TO PLAY GOLF, REMEMBER?
我以为我们在这里
打高尔夫球，还记得吗？

07:58.517 --> 08:01.793
- OKAY, OKAY!
- 好吧，好吧！

08:01.827 --> 08:03.896
- NOW WHERE IS THAT
DARN BALL?
- 现在那在哪里
该死的球？

08:03.931 --> 08:05.172
- OOH!
- 哦！

08:05.206 --> 08:06.827
- PATRICK, HAVE YOU
SEEN MY BALL?
- 帕特里克，你有吗
看到我的球了吗？

08:06.862 --> 08:08.241
- WAS IT A RED ONE?
- 是红色的吗？

08:08.275 --> 08:09.310
- MM-HMM.
- 嗯嗯。

08:09.344 --> 08:11.448
- MIGHT HAVE BEEN
IN THE KELP SALAD.
- 可能是
在海带沙拉中。

08:11.482 --> 08:13.275
- PATRICK,
YOU ATE MY BALL?
- 帕特里克，
你吃了我的球？

08:13.310 --> 08:14.689
- DON'T WORRY.
I'LL GET IT.
- 不用担心。
我会得到它。

08:14.724 --> 08:16.620
- PATRICK, NO!
- NO?
- 帕特里克，不！
- 不？

08:16.655 --> 08:20.172
- I HAVE TO PLAY THE BALL
WHERE IT LIES.
- 我必须打球
它在哪里。

08:22.448 --> 08:24.448
WE'LL NEED TO
LEAVE THIS OPEN.
我们需要
保持打开状态。

08:24.482 --> 08:27.172
NOW, LET'S SEE,
IF I WAS A GOLF BALL,
现在，让我们看看，
如果我是一个高尔夫球，

08:27.206 --> 08:28.275
WHERE WOULD I--OH!
我会在哪里——哦！

08:28.310 --> 08:30.931
NEXT TO THE GALLBLADDER,
OF COURSE.
胆囊旁边，
当然。

08:30.965 --> 08:32.827
FORE!
前面！

08:32.862 --> 08:34.689
[crashing and shattering]
[崩溃和破碎]

08:34.724 --> 08:35.862
- [mutters]
- [嘀咕]

08:37.310 --> 08:38.413
- WHERE'S YOUR BALL?
- 你的球在哪里？

08:38.448 --> 08:39.482
- I DON'T KNOW.
- 我不知道。

08:39.517 --> 08:41.310
GOTTA BE AROUND HERE
SOMEWHERE.
必须在这附近
某处。

08:41.344 --> 08:42.655
- THERE IT IS.
- 就在那里。

08:42.689 --> 08:43.655
- UH-OH.
- 呃-哦。

08:43.689 --> 08:45.827
- PLAY IT WHERE IT LIES.
- 在它所在的地方播放。

08:45.862 --> 08:46.896
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

08:46.931 --> 08:48.206
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

08:53.275 --> 08:56.655
[crashing and shattering]
[崩溃和破碎]

08:56.689 --> 08:58.172
HOLE IN ONE!
一杆进洞！

08:58.206 --> 08:59.517
TOP THAT!
顶一下！

08:59.551 --> 09:02.206
- I COULD DO THAT
BLINDFOLDED.
- 我能做到
蒙住眼睛。

09:02.241 --> 09:04.586
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

09:04.620 --> 09:05.586
[thud]
OW!
[砰]
噢！

09:05.620 --> 09:07.068
[tapping]
[窃听]

09:07.103 --> 09:08.344
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:08.379 --> 09:09.862
- HEY, WAIT UP!
- 嘿，等等！

09:09.896 --> 09:11.689
WARMER. WARMER.
更温暖。更温暖。

09:11.724 --> 09:12.689
RED HOT!
红热！

09:12.724 --> 09:13.724
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

09:13.758 --> 09:16.103
- WARMER. WARMER.
- 更温暖。更温暖。

09:16.137 --> 09:18.448
COLDER. COLDER.
更冷。更冷。

09:18.482 --> 09:20.379
WARMER. WARMER.
更温暖。更温暖。

09:20.413 --> 09:22.068
WARMER. HOT!
更温暖。热的！

09:22.103 --> 09:23.689
HOTTER. RED HOT!
更热。红热！

09:23.724 --> 09:24.758
RED HOT!
红热！

09:24.793 --> 09:25.758
[crash]
[碰撞]

09:25.793 --> 09:27.172
NO, WAIT.
MY MISTAKE.
不，等等。
我的错误。

09:27.206 --> 09:28.482
YOU'RE ICE COLD.
你很冷。

09:28.517 --> 09:30.379
WARMER. WARMER.
更温暖。更温暖。

09:30.413 --> 09:32.482
HOT. HOT. RED HOT!
热的。热的。红热！

09:32.517 --> 09:34.241
RED HOT! SMOKIN' HOT!
红热！热气腾腾！

09:34.275 --> 09:36.310
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

09:36.344 --> 09:39.655
- [mutters]
- [嘀咕]

09:39.689 --> 09:40.862
- WRONG AGAIN.
- 又错了。

09:40.896 --> 09:43.241
- PATRICK.
- STOP PEEKING!
- 帕特里克。
- 别偷看！

09:43.275 --> 09:44.241
HOTTER.
更热。

09:44.275 --> 09:45.275
[crash]
[碰撞]

09:45.310 --> 09:46.275
COLDER. HOTTER.
更冷。更热。

09:46.310 --> 09:47.586
[crashing and shattering]
[崩溃和破碎]

09:47.620 --> 09:48.586
HOT!
热的！

09:48.620 --> 09:49.586
COLD.
寒冷的。

09:49.620 --> 09:50.586
HOT!
热的！

09:50.620 --> 09:51.586
COLD.
寒冷的。

09:51.620 --> 09:52.586
HOT!
热的！

09:52.620 --> 09:53.586
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

09:53.620 --> 09:54.586
COOL. HOT!
凉爽的。热的！

09:54.620 --> 09:55.586
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

09:55.620 --> 09:57.034
COLD.
- PATRICK!
寒冷的。
- 帕特里克！

09:57.068 --> 09:59.379
THIS IS RIDIC--ULOUS.
这太荒谬了。

09:59.413 --> 10:02.586
WOW, SQUIDWARD'S REALLY
LET THIS PLACE GO.
哇，真的是章鱼哥
让这个地方走吧。

10:02.620 --> 10:03.586
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

10:03.620 --> 10:04.586
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

10:04.620 --> 10:06.000
- WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
- 你在干什么？

10:06.034 --> 10:07.586
- I WAS JUST FRESHENING UP.
- 我刚刚梳洗了一下。

10:07.620 --> 10:10.586
BUT THESE FANCY FIXTURES
ARE TOUCHY.
但这些精美的装置
很敏感。

10:10.620 --> 10:12.586
HOT! RED HOT!
热的！红热！

10:12.620 --> 10:15.103
AAH! COLD, COLD, COLD!
啊啊！ COLD, COLD, COLD!

10:15.137 --> 10:17.551
- WOULD YOU PLEASE
GET BACK IN THE GAME?
- 可以吗
重返游戏？

10:17.586 --> 10:20.655
- BUT I WANTED TO TRY
HIS LOOFAH!
- 但我想尝试
他的丝瓜络！

10:20.689 --> 10:24.586
- THOSE BALLS HAVE GOT TO
BE AROUND HERE SOMEWHERE.
- 那些球必须
就在这附近的某个地方。

10:24.620 --> 10:27.068
OH, PATRICK!
哦，帕特里克！

10:27.103 --> 10:28.724
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

10:28.758 --> 10:32.206
- UH, LOOK
A LITTLE CLOSER, BUDDY.
- 呃，看
再近一点，伙计。

10:32.241 --> 10:35.586
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

10:35.620 --> 10:37.931
- PLAY IT WHERE IT LIES?
- 在哪里玩？

10:37.965 --> 10:40.137
- PLAY IT
WHERE IT LIES.
- 玩吧
它在哪里。

10:40.172 --> 10:41.758
- BUT HOW ARE WE
GONNA HIT OUR BALLS
- 但我们怎么样
会击中我们的球

10:41.793 --> 10:43.206
BACK TO MY HOUSE
FROM HERE?
回到我家
从这里出发？

10:43.241 --> 10:45.758
- ALL IT TAKES IS A LITTLE
FINESSE, SPONGEBOB.
- 只需一点点
技巧，海绵宝宝。

10:45.793 --> 10:47.758
ALL IT TAKES
IS A LITTLE FINESSE.
一切都需要
有点技巧。

10:47.793 --> 10:48.758
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

10:48.793 --> 10:50.103
[squeaks]
[吱吱声]

10:50.137 --> 10:51.172
- OKAY,
YOU'RE GOOD TO GO.
- 好吧，
你可以走了。

10:51.206 --> 10:52.172
- FORE!
- 前面！

10:52.206 --> 10:53.344
[crash]
[碰撞]

10:55.310 --> 10:56.275
IT'S ALL YOURS.
都是你的。

10:59.103 --> 11:01.310
- THIS ONE'S FOR
ALL THE MARBLES.
- 这个是为了
所有的弹珠。

11:01.344 --> 11:02.758
- I THOUGHT
WE WEREN'T BETTING.
- 我以为
我们没有打赌。

11:02.793 --> 11:05.068
- NO, I MEAN WHOEVER WINS
THIS HOLE WINS THE GAME.
- 不，我的意思是无论谁赢了
这个洞赢得了比赛。

11:05.103 --> 11:07.068
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

11:07.103 --> 11:08.344
[no audio]
[没有音频]

11:09.517 --> 11:12.517
- [slurred]
WHAT'S GOING ON HERE?
- [含糊不清]
这是怎么回事？

11:14.344 --> 11:16.275
AAH!
啊啊！

11:16.310 --> 11:17.275
[balls whistling
through the air]
[球呼啸着
通过空气]

11:17.310 --> 11:18.241
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

11:18.275 --> 11:19.275
- MEOW!
- 喵！

11:19.310 --> 11:21.586
both: HOLE IN ONE!
两人：一杆进洞！

11:21.620 --> 11:22.724
- [sweetly]
GOOD MORNING.
- [甜蜜地]
早上好。

11:22.758 --> 11:24.310
- SORRY WE WOKE YOU.
- 抱歉我们吵醒了你。

11:24.344 --> 11:27.275
- WHAT? WHAT?
- 什么？什么？

11:27.310 --> 11:29.241
- HEY, SQUIDWARD, WHAT
HAPPENED TO YOUR DENTURES?
- 嘿，章鱼哥，什么
您的假牙出了问题吗？

11:29.275 --> 11:30.793
[dentures clacking]
[假牙嘎嘎作响]

11:30.827 --> 11:31.793
[crash]
[碰撞]

11:31.827 --> 11:32.862
- GOOD GAME, PAL.
- 好游戏，朋友。

11:32.896 --> 11:34.068
- REMATCH NEXT SATURDAY?
- 下周六重赛？

11:34.103 --> 11:36.172
- RAIN OR SHINE, SPONGEBOB.
- 风雨无阻，海绵宝宝。

11:36.206 --> 11:38.931
RAIN OR SHINE.
风雨无阻。

11:38.965 --> 11:39.931
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

11:39.965 --> 11:42.103
[crash]
[碰撞]

11:42.137 --> 11:44.827
- GUYS? YOU GUYS?
- 伙计们？你们？

11:47.896 --> 11:50.862
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

11:50.896 --> 11:56.068
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

11:56.103 --> 11:57.482
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

11:57.517 --> 12:02.000
- [French accent] AH, ZEE FIRST
DAY OF SPRING IN BIKINI BOTTOM.
- [法国口音] AH, ZEE FIRST
穿着比基尼下装的春天。

12:02.034 --> 12:04.241
ZEE FLOWERS ARE BLOOMING.
ZEE 鲜花盛开。

12:04.275 --> 12:08.586
THE RAINBOWS ARE,
HOW YOU SAY, BOWING.
彩虹是，
怎么说呢，鞠躬。

12:08.620 --> 12:10.551
ZEE JELLYFISH ARE BUZZING.
ZEE 水母嗡嗡作响。

12:10.586 --> 12:12.034
[jellyfish buzzing]
[水母嗡嗡声]

12:12.068 --> 12:13.620
[flowers popping]
[花开]

12:13.655 --> 12:16.758
- AND IT IS TIME
FOR ZEE TRADITIONAL...
- 现在是时候了
对于 ZEE 传统...

12:16.793 --> 12:18.931
- SPRING CLEANING!
- 春季大扫除！

12:18.965 --> 12:21.655
GUESS WHAT TIME OF YEAR
IT IS, GARY.
猜猜一年中的什么时间
是的，加里。

12:21.689 --> 12:23.034
- MEOW!
- 喵！

12:23.068 --> 12:24.931
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

12:24.965 --> 12:28.137
[motor starts]
[电机启动]

12:30.896 --> 12:32.758
- ♪ LA DA DA DA DEE
- ♪ 拉达达达达迪

12:32.793 --> 12:34.724
♪ LA DA DA LA LA LA LA
♪ 拉达达拉拉拉拉

12:34.758 --> 12:37.137
♪ LA LA LA WAH
♪ 啦啦啦哇

12:51.689 --> 12:52.724
[laughs]
[笑]

12:52.758 --> 12:53.896
THANKS FOR YOUR HELP, GAR.
感谢您的帮助，GAR。

12:53.931 --> 12:54.931
- MEOW!
- 喵！

12:54.965 --> 12:59.827
- [whistling a tune]
- [吹口哨]

12:59.862 --> 13:01.517
- HEY, SPONGEBOB.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

13:01.551 --> 13:03.758
- HI, PATRICK. HOW'S YOUR
SPRING CLEANING GOING?
- 嗨，帕特里克。你怎么样
春季大扫除正在进行吗？

13:03.793 --> 13:04.965
- [stuttering]
SKE-OOH-PAH!
- [结巴]
斯凯-哦-呸！

13:05.000 --> 13:06.758
IT'S SPRING CLEANING DAY?
今天是春季大扫除日吗？

13:06.793 --> 13:08.965
WHY DIDN'T ANYONE TELL ME?
为什么没有人告诉我？

13:09.000 --> 13:11.034
[grunts]
[咕哝]

13:11.068 --> 13:12.034
[thud]
[砰]

13:13.068 --> 13:16.655
[clatter and banging]
[叮当声和撞击声]

13:16.689 --> 13:17.689
[gasps]
[喘气]

13:17.724 --> 13:19.000
FOUND IT!
找到了！

13:19.034 --> 13:21.310
THANKS FOR THE REMINDER,
SPONGEBOB.
感谢您的提醒，
海绵宝宝。

13:25.689 --> 13:28.482
SEE YOU AGAIN NEXT SPRING!
明年春天再见！

13:28.517 --> 13:31.655
WHAT YOU GOT
IN YOUR TRASHCAN?
你得到了什么
在你的垃圾桶里？

13:33.241 --> 13:34.413
[gasps]
[喘气]

13:34.448 --> 13:36.724
YOU'RE THROWING THIS AWAY?
你要把这个扔掉吗？

13:36.758 --> 13:40.413
THE WRAPPER FROM THE GUM
I GAVE YOU YESTERDAY?
口香糖的包装纸
我昨天给了你？

13:40.448 --> 13:41.620
- OH, YEAH.
- 哦，是的。

13:41.655 --> 13:42.724
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

13:42.758 --> 13:44.517
SOME PEOPLE JUST DON'T
UNDERSTAND
有些人就是不这样做
明白

13:44.551 --> 13:46.862
SENTIMENTAL VALUE.
情感价值。

13:46.896 --> 13:48.413
[gasps]
[喘气]

13:48.448 --> 13:52.344
YOU'RE THROWING AWAY PETE?
你要扔掉皮特吗？

13:52.379 --> 13:55.689
Y-YOU CAN PART
WITH A KEEPSAKE!
你-你可以分开
带纪念品！

13:55.724 --> 13:59.586
THAT'S WHY YOU KEEP THEM,
FOR PETE'S SAKE!
这就是你保留它们的原因，
看在皮特的份上！

13:59.620 --> 14:02.241
HMMPH!
WHY, I'M DISGUSTED!
哼！
为什么，我很厌恶！

14:02.275 --> 14:06.275
IT'S TIME YOU REEVALUATE
YOUR PRIORITIES!
是时候重新评估了
您的优先事项！

14:09.482 --> 14:12.241
- HMM.
MAYBE PATRICK'S RIGHT.
- 唔。
也许帕特里克是对的。

14:12.275 --> 14:14.689
ALL OF THESE THINGS DO HOLD
PRECIOUS MEMORIES.
所有这些都成立
珍贵的回忆。

14:14.724 --> 14:16.068
[clank]
[铮铮]

14:16.103 --> 14:17.241
[steam hisses]
[蒸汽嘶嘶声]

14:17.275 --> 14:19.310
- OH! NO!
- 哦！不！

14:19.344 --> 14:21.379
[grunts]
[咕哝]

14:21.413 --> 14:22.620
COME BACK HERE!
回到这里！

14:22.655 --> 14:24.655
[grunts]
[咕哝]

14:24.689 --> 14:26.655
[gears grind]
[齿轮磨削]

14:26.689 --> 14:28.379
[straining]
[紧张]

14:28.413 --> 14:30.448
AH! GOTCHA!
啊！明白了！

14:30.482 --> 14:33.034
[horn toots]
[喇叭嘟嘟]

14:33.068 --> 14:35.655
WELCOME HOME,
PRECIOUS MEMORIES.
欢迎回家，
珍贵的回忆。

14:35.689 --> 14:38.655
[popping]
[爆裂声]

14:38.689 --> 14:40.275
[clank]
[铮铮]

14:40.310 --> 14:41.310
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

14:58.241 --> 15:01.413
PLASTIC WRAP IS NEAT,
HUH, GARY?
塑料包装很整洁，
嗯，加里？

15:01.448 --> 15:02.448
- NO.
- 不。

15:02.482 --> 15:04.137
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

15:04.172 --> 15:05.137
[bell dings]
[铃声]

15:05.172 --> 15:06.620
- ORDER UP!
- 订购！

15:06.655 --> 15:08.206
CAREFUL WITH THESE ONES,
SQUIDWARD.
小心这些，
章鱼哥。

15:08.241 --> 15:09.344
THEY'RE SPECIAL.
他们很特别。

15:09.379 --> 15:11.620
- OH, DEAR ME.
I KNOW.
- 哦，亲爱的我。
我知道。

15:11.655 --> 15:14.344
I HOPE I NEVER FORGET
THIS MOMENT.
我希望我永远不会忘记
这一刻。

15:14.379 --> 15:16.448
- [gasps]
YOU'RE RIGHT!
- [喘气]
你是对的！

15:16.482 --> 15:19.103
I'M GOING TO NEED SOMETHING
TO PRESERVE THE MEMORY.
我需要一些东西
保护记忆。

15:19.137 --> 15:20.517
OH, PERFECT.
哦，完美。

15:20.551 --> 15:23.034
[scraping]
[刮]

15:23.068 --> 15:24.896
AH, MEMORIES.
啊，回忆。

15:24.931 --> 15:27.000
GREASY MEMORIES.
油腻的回忆。

15:27.034 --> 15:28.448
[door bangs]
[门刘海]

15:28.482 --> 15:29.827
WHOO-WHEE!
哇喔！

15:29.862 --> 15:31.793
NOTHING LIKE A HARD DAY'S WORK
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB,
没有什么比一天辛苦的工作更重要的了
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅，

15:31.827 --> 15:32.793
EH, SQUIDWARD?
呃，章鱼哥？

15:32.827 --> 15:34.586
WHOO!
哇！

15:39.034 --> 15:40.931
- YOU'RE SENTIMENTAL
ABOUT YOUR SWEAT?
- 你很感性
关于你的汗水？

15:40.965 --> 15:43.551
- AW, THAT'S NOT ALL.
- 哦，这还不是全部。

15:43.586 --> 15:45.310
AND I'M ALSO
VERY SENTIMENTAL
我也是
非常感伤

15:45.344 --> 15:47.275
ABOUT THESE
KRUSTY KRAB KEEPSAKES.
关于这些
脆皮蟹纪念品。

15:47.310 --> 15:48.758
SO MANY MEMORIES.
这么多的回忆。

15:48.793 --> 15:51.896
GRILL GREASE, GUM FROM
UNDER THE KRUSTY KRAB TABLES,
烧烤油、胶来自
在脆皮蟹桌子下，

15:51.931 --> 15:54.758
TODAY'S MOP WATER,
BENDY STRAWS,
今天的拖把水，
弯曲吸管，

15:54.793 --> 15:58.482
MAYONNAISE, A COLLECTION OF
FRESHLY-USED KETCHUP PACKETS,
蛋黄酱，一系列
新鲜使用的番茄酱包，

15:58.517 --> 16:00.344
AND THESE ARE
TODAY'S ORDER TICKETS
这些是
今日订购门票

16:00.379 --> 16:03.448
WRITTEN BY MY FAVORITE
FELLOW EMPLOYEE, SQUIDWARD.
由我最喜欢的人写的
同事，章鱼哥。

16:03.482 --> 16:05.689
SEE? THIS ONE HAS
YOUR TENTACLE PRINT ON IT.
看？这个有
上面印有你的触手。

16:05.724 --> 16:08.655
- OKAY, THIS IS
GETTING CREEPY NOW.
- 好吧，这是
现在变得令人毛骨悚然。

16:08.689 --> 16:09.793
- OH, WELL,
I GUESS I'D BETTER
- 哦，好吧，
我想我会更好

16:09.827 --> 16:11.620
GET THESE PRECIOUS
MEMORIES HOME.
获得这些珍贵的
回忆之家。

16:11.655 --> 16:13.965
- OFFICIALLY
CREEPED OUT NOW.
- 正式
现在就爬出来了。

16:14.000 --> 16:15.137
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

16:15.172 --> 16:16.448
- ♪ MEMORIES
- ♪ 回忆

16:16.482 --> 16:18.448
♪ DOO DOO DOO DOO
DOO DOO DOO ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟
嘟嘟嘟♪

16:18.482 --> 16:19.827
♪ MEMORIES
♪ 回忆

16:19.862 --> 16:21.655
[grunts]
[咕哝]

16:26.137 --> 16:27.103
[Gary straining]
[加里紧张]

16:27.137 --> 16:28.931
- HI, GARY.
- 嗨，加里。

16:30.275 --> 16:33.275
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

16:33.310 --> 16:35.068
[wagon wheels squeaking]
[马车车轮吱吱作响]

16:37.517 --> 16:39.724
OOH.
哦。

16:39.758 --> 16:41.862
THERE. SAFE AND SOUND.
那里。安全可靠。

16:41.896 --> 16:46.724
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

16:46.758 --> 16:48.172
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

16:48.206 --> 16:49.344
[straining]
[紧张]

16:49.379 --> 16:50.344
[grunts]
[咕哝]

16:50.379 --> 16:52.413
WHEW!
CLOSED UP TIGHT.
哇！
紧闭。

16:52.448 --> 16:53.965
AND YOU SAID
IT WOULDN'T FIT.
你说
它不合适。

16:54.000 --> 16:54.965
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

16:55.000 --> 16:56.103
[grunts]
[咕哝]

16:56.137 --> 16:59.172
[Gary articulating
indistinctly]
[加里阐明
隐隐约约]

16:59.206 --> 17:00.724
OH, NONSENSE, GARY.
哦，胡说，加里。

17:00.758 --> 17:02.379
I'LL FIND SOMEWHERE
TO PUT EVERYTHING.
我会找到一个地方
把一切都放进去。

17:02.413 --> 17:04.482
LIKE THE FRONT YARD.
就像前院一样。

17:07.965 --> 17:08.931
[clatter]
[哒]

17:08.965 --> 17:10.068
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

17:10.103 --> 17:13.586
- [snoring and muttering]
- [打鼾和嘀咕]

17:13.620 --> 17:15.724
[alarm rings]
[警报响起]

17:15.758 --> 17:17.448
[yawns]
[哈欠]

17:17.482 --> 17:19.413
[smacks lips]
[咂嘴]

17:20.413 --> 17:22.310
[sighs]
[叹气]

17:23.758 --> 17:24.827
[clatter]
[哒]

17:26.413 --> 17:27.586
[clatter]
[哒]

17:27.620 --> 17:28.620
[gasps]
[喘气]

17:30.655 --> 17:36.620
[grunts]
[咕哝]

17:36.655 --> 17:37.827
[groaning]
[呻吟]

17:37.862 --> 17:38.827
[clang]
[铛]

17:38.862 --> 17:39.965
[moans]
[呻吟声]

17:40.000 --> 17:41.275
[pounding]
[重击]

17:41.310 --> 17:43.344
- ♪ WHO IS IT?
- ♪ 是谁？

17:43.379 --> 17:45.034
- IT'S SQUIDWARD.
- 这是章鱼哥。

17:45.068 --> 17:46.275
- HOW DO I KNOW IT'S YOU?
- 我怎么知道是你？

17:46.310 --> 17:48.517
- OPEN THE DOOR, NITWIT!
- 开门吧，白痴！

17:48.551 --> 17:51.275
- OH, HI, SQUIDWARD.
CAN I HELP YOU?
- 哦，嗨，章鱼哥。
我可以帮你吗？

17:51.310 --> 17:53.137
- YOU CERTAINLY CAN HEL--
- 你当然可以帮助--

17:56.517 --> 17:59.103
WHY ARE YOU
WEARING GARBAGE?
你为什么
穿着垃圾？

17:59.137 --> 18:01.413
- THANKS FOR NOTICING,
SQUIDWARD.
- 感谢您的关注，
章鱼哥。

18:01.448 --> 18:02.931
AND MAY I SAY THAT'S
A VERY BECOMING DRESS
我可以这么说吗
非常合身的连衣裙

18:02.965 --> 18:04.413
YOU'REWEARING
THIS MORNING.
你穿着
今天早上。

18:04.448 --> 18:08.344
- DRESS? IT'S NOT A DRESS!
IT'S A NIGHTSHIRT! D'OH!
- 裙子？这不是一件衣服！
这是睡衣！天啊！

18:08.379 --> 18:10.310
IF YOU DON'T GET RID
OF THIS TRASH,
如果你不摆脱
这些垃圾，

18:10.344 --> 18:14.655
I'M CALLING
THE SANITATION POLICE.
我正在打电话
环卫警察。

18:14.689 --> 18:16.482
- AAH!
NOT THE SANITATION POLICE!
- 啊啊！
不是环卫警察！

18:16.517 --> 18:18.413
EEEHHHH!
YOU DON'T UNDERSTAND!
诶诶诶！
你不明白！

18:18.448 --> 18:19.931
THESE THINGS AREN'T JUNK!
这些东西不是垃圾！

18:19.965 --> 18:21.413
THEY'RE MY FRIENDS.
他们是我的朋友。

18:21.448 --> 18:24.344
LIKE THIS LITTLE GUY,
ALFRED THE LIGHT BULB.
就像这个小家伙，
阿尔弗雷德灯泡。

18:24.379 --> 18:26.965
OH, WE HAD SOME
GREAT TIMES TOGETHER, AL,
哦，我们有一些
一起度过美好时光，阿尔，

18:27.000 --> 18:29.103
READING, PAYING THE BILLS.
阅读、支付账单。

18:29.137 --> 18:31.068
WHY IS IT THE ONES
WHO GLOW BRIGHTEST
为什么是这些
谁的光芒最耀眼

18:31.103 --> 18:32.275
BURN OUT THE SOONEST?
最快耗尽？

18:32.310 --> 18:33.310
[sniffles]
[抽鼻子]

18:33.344 --> 18:36.724
YOU WILL BE MISSED.
我们会想念您的。

18:36.758 --> 18:38.310
[sniffles]
[抽鼻子]

18:38.344 --> 18:41.206
- TOUCHING. STILL CREEPY,
BUT TOUCHING.
- 感人。仍然令人毛骨悚然，
但很感人。

18:41.241 --> 18:42.482
TIME TO MAKE A PHONE CALL.
是时候打电话了。

18:42.517 --> 18:43.482
[line ringing]
[线路铃声]

18:43.517 --> 18:44.482
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

18:44.517 --> 18:45.862
[siren]
[警笛]

18:48.103 --> 18:50.068
- SANITATION POLICE!
- 环卫警察！

18:50.103 --> 18:51.517
THIS IS A RAID!
这是一次突袭！

18:51.551 --> 18:54.517
STEP AWAY FROM THE REFUSE!
远离拒绝！

18:54.551 --> 18:56.551
- THANK GOODNESS
YOU'RE HERE, OFFICER.
-谢天谢地
你在这里，警官。

18:56.586 --> 18:58.896
- IS THIS YOUR FILTHY HOME?
- 这是你肮脏的家吗？

18:58.931 --> 19:00.758
- NO, IT IS NOT MY HOME!
- 不，这不是我的家！

19:00.793 --> 19:04.655
IT BELONGS TO
THAT FILTHY LITTLE DIRTBAG!
它属于
那个肮脏的小土袋！

19:04.689 --> 19:06.172
- HI.
- 你好。

19:06.206 --> 19:09.275
- THANKS FOR
THE INFORMATION, CITIZEN!
- 谢谢
信息，公民！

19:11.965 --> 19:13.965
- HUH. SNITCH.
- 嗯。举报。

19:15.379 --> 19:18.586
- DO YOUR DUTY, SERGEANT.
- 履行你的职责，中士。

19:21.620 --> 19:25.275
THIS RESIDENCE
IS NOW CONDEMNED.
这栋住宅
现在已被谴责。

19:25.310 --> 19:27.724
- CONDEMNED?
WHAT DOES THAT MEAN?
- 谴责？
这意味着什么？

19:27.758 --> 19:31.241
- CONDEMNED MEANS THIS HOUSE
IS UNFIT TO LIVE IN.
- 谴责意味着这所房子
不适合居住。

19:31.275 --> 19:33.551
YOU'LL HAVE TO VACATE
THE HOME IMMEDIATELY.
你必须离开
立即回家。

19:33.586 --> 19:36.000
- VACATE?
YOU MEAN, I HAVE TO MOVE?
- 撤离？
你的意思是，我必须搬家？

19:36.034 --> 19:38.275
- ANYTHING THAT IS A THREAT
TO PUBLIC HEALTH
- 任何构成威胁的事情
为了公众健康

19:38.310 --> 19:40.448
MUST BE CONDEMNED.
必须受到谴责。

19:40.482 --> 19:41.793
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

19:41.827 --> 19:43.103
SERGEANT.
军士。

19:45.172 --> 19:46.965
- THANK YOU AGAIN,
OFFICERS.
- 再次感谢您，
官员们。

19:47.000 --> 19:49.551
- WAIT! PLEASE DON'T
CONDEMN MY HOUSE!
- 等待！请不要
谴责我的房子！

19:49.586 --> 19:52.310
- SORRY, SPONGEBOB.
THE LAW IS THE LAW.
- 对不起，海绵宝宝。
法律就是法律。

19:52.344 --> 19:55.793
WE CAN'T JUST PICK AND CHOOSE
THE ONES WE FOLLOW.
我们不能只是挑选
我们追随的人。

19:55.827 --> 19:57.965
- I'LL REQUEST
A COMMENDATION FOR YOU!
- 我会请求
给你的嘉奖！

19:58.000 --> 19:59.068
- REALLY?
- 真的吗？

19:59.103 --> 20:01.655
- RIGHT AFTER WE CONDEMN
YOURHOUSE!
- 在我们谴责之后
你的房子！

20:01.689 --> 20:03.448
- Y--MY HOUSE?
- YES!
- Y--我的房子？
- 是的！

20:03.482 --> 20:05.344
IT'S AS FILTHY
AS YOUR NEIGHBOR'S.
它很脏
正如您的邻居一样。

20:05.379 --> 20:07.724
- BUT ISN'T THERE ANYTHING
WE CAN DO?
- 但什么都没有
我们能做什么？

20:07.758 --> 20:09.724
- YOU CAN VACATE
THE PREMISES
- 你可以离开
场地

20:09.758 --> 20:14.896
OR THROW AWAY YOUR JUNK.
或者扔掉你的垃圾。

20:14.931 --> 20:16.137
- THROW THEM AWAY?
- 把它们扔掉？

20:16.172 --> 20:18.689
- THANK YOU FOR THE TIP,
MA'AM!
- 谢谢你的提示，
女士！

20:18.724 --> 20:19.931
- "MA'AM"?
- “女士”？

20:19.965 --> 20:22.103
IT'S A NIGHTSHIRT!
这是睡衣！

20:22.137 --> 20:23.103
[door slams]
[关门声]

20:23.137 --> 20:26.034
[siren]
[警笛]

20:26.068 --> 20:27.344
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

20:34.241 --> 20:36.862
THIS IS ALL YOUR FAULT!
这都是你的错！

20:36.896 --> 20:39.034
YOU HAVE TO GET RID
OF YOUR JUNK RIGHT NOW!
你必须摆脱
立即处理您的垃圾！

20:39.068 --> 20:41.379
- I KNOW.
- 我知道。

20:41.413 --> 20:45.000
[crying]
[哭泣]

20:45.034 --> 20:48.241
I'M GONNA MISS THEM
SO MUCH!
我会想念他们的
这么多！

20:48.275 --> 20:51.000
[crying]
[哭泣]

20:51.034 --> 20:53.310
- YOU'LL REALLY MISS THEM?
- 你真的会想念他们吗？

20:53.344 --> 20:56.862
- NO.
I'LL BE STRONG.
- 不。
我会坚强的。

20:56.896 --> 20:58.586
[crying]
[哭泣]

20:58.620 --> 21:02.137
- WELL, MAYBE YOU COULD
TAKE PHOTOS OF ALL YOUR JUNK--
- 好吧，也许你可以
给你所有的垃圾拍张照片——

21:02.172 --> 21:05.000
UH, FRIENDS BEFORE YOU
TOSS THEM AWAY.
呃，在你之前的朋友们
把它们扔掉。

21:05.034 --> 21:07.206
- THAT'S A GREAT IDEA,
SQUIDWARD!
- 这是个好主意，
章鱼哥！

21:07.241 --> 21:09.862
THEN, YEARS FROM NOW,
I CAN LOOK AT THE PHOTOS
然后，几年后，
我可以看看照片

21:09.896 --> 21:11.482
AND REMEMBER MY...
并记住我的...

21:11.517 --> 21:14.103
REMEMBER MY PRECIOUS
LITTLE BABIES!
记住我的宝贝
小宝贝们！

21:14.137 --> 21:15.241
- CREEPY.
- 令人毛骨悚然。

21:15.275 --> 21:16.275
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

21:16.310 --> 21:19.034
- SAY "BARNACLES."
- 说“藤壶”。

21:19.068 --> 21:21.689
[camera shutter clicking]
[相机快门点击]

21:21.724 --> 21:23.862
THAT'S IT.
WORK IT!
就是这样。
工作吧！

21:23.896 --> 21:25.310
[click]
[点击]

21:25.344 --> 21:27.034
NICE. VERY NICE.
好的。很不错。

21:27.068 --> 21:28.034
NOW BE ANGRY.
现在生气吧。

21:28.068 --> 21:29.068
[clicks]
[点击次数]

21:29.103 --> 21:30.793
AMAZING.
NOW LOOK POUTY.
惊人的。
现在看起来噘嘴。

21:30.827 --> 21:32.655
NOW SMUG.
现在沾沾自喜。

21:32.689 --> 21:34.241
OH, THAT'S IT.
BEAUTIFUL!
哦，就是这样。
美丽的！

21:34.275 --> 21:37.379
[clicks]
[点击次数]

21:37.413 --> 21:38.413
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

21:44.068 --> 21:45.931
- OH, GOOD GRIEF.
- 噢，真是悲伤。

21:45.965 --> 21:48.000
- [sniffles]
- [抽鼻子]

21:50.862 --> 21:51.827
[clank]
[铮铮]

21:51.862 --> 21:53.551
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

21:53.586 --> 21:55.034
- YOUR PAY, MY GOOD MAN.
- 你的报酬，我的好人。

21:57.931 --> 21:58.896
- [sniffles]
- [抽鼻子]

21:58.931 --> 22:00.931
GOOD-BYE, LITTLE FRIENDS.
再见，小朋友们。

22:00.965 --> 22:02.586
HAVE FUN AT THE DUMP.
在垃圾场玩得开心。

22:02.620 --> 22:04.241
[engine starts]
[发动机启动]

22:07.068 --> 22:10.275
- WELL, NOW THAT YOU'VE
COMPLETELY RUINED MY DAY,
- 好吧，现在你已经
完全毁了我的一天，

22:10.310 --> 22:12.758
ONCE AGAIN,
I'M GOING BACK TO BED!
再次，
我要回去睡觉了！

22:12.793 --> 22:14.241
- ALL RIGHT.
NIGHTY NIGHT!
- 好的。
晚安！

22:14.275 --> 22:15.586
- IDIOT.
- 笨蛋。

22:16.655 --> 22:19.034
[rumble]
[隆隆]

22:19.068 --> 22:21.689
WHAT THE--?
什么——？

22:21.724 --> 22:25.137
SPONGEBOB, WHY IS MY HOUSE
FILLED WITH PHOTOS
海绵宝宝，为什么是我的房子
充满照片

22:25.172 --> 22:27.034
OF YOUR DUMB JUNK?
你的愚蠢垃圾？

22:27.068 --> 22:28.689
- OH, I FORGOT TO TELL YOU.
- 哦，我忘了告诉你。

22:28.724 --> 22:31.379
I TOOK SO MANY PICTURES,
I RAN OUT OF ROOM IN MY HOUSE.
我拍了很多照片，
我的房子已经没有空间了。

22:31.413 --> 22:37.896
[rumble]
[隆隆]

22:37.931 --> 22:39.275
- NICE DRESS.
- 漂亮的衣服。

22:39.310 --> 22:42.310
- IT'S A NIGHTSHIRT!
- 这是一件睡衣！

